                <div class="bg-white text-center h-100 p-4 p-xl-5 rounded-4 shadow-sm border-bottom border-4 border-primary">
                    <i class="fa fa-medal text-primary mb-4" style="font-size: 4rem;"></i>
                    <h4 class="mb-3 fw-bold">Chất Lượng Uy Tín</h4>
                    <p class="mb-4">Chỉ phân phối các mặt hàng đến từ các thương hiệu danh tiếng, đảm bảo trải nghiệm hoàn hảo.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-6 wow fadeInUp" data-wow-delay="0.5s">
                <div class="bg-white text-center h-100 p-4 p-xl-5 rounded-4 shadow-sm border-bottom border-4 border-primary">
                    <i class="fa fa-headset text-primary mb-4" style="font-size: 4rem;"></i>
                    <h4 class="mb-3 fw-bold">Tận Tâm Phục Vụ</h4>
                    <p class="mb-4">Đội ngũ chuyên viên tư vấn am hiểu sâu sắc, sẵn sàng hỗ trợ khách hàng 24/7 trong suốt quá trình sử dụng.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<style>
    .team-card {
        background: linear-gradient(#151515, #151515) padding-box,
                    linear-gradient(135deg, #CF9E52, #E6C587, #AD7B3B, #E6C587) border-box !important;
        border: 2.5px solid transparent !important;
        border-radius: 20px;
        transition: all 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
    }
    .team-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-10px);
        box-shadow: 0 15px 35px rgba(207, 158, 82, 0.35) !important; /* Soft luxury gold glow */
        background: linear-gradient(#1a1a1a, #1a1a1a) padding-box,
                    linear-gradient(135deg, #E6C587, #FFFFFF, #CF9E52, #E6C587) border-box !important;
    }
    .team-card h5 {
        color: #ffffff !important;
        font-family: 'Lora', serif;
        letter-spacing: 0.5px;
    }
    .team-card p.text-primary {
        color: #E6C587 !important; /* Luxury champagne gold text */
        font-weight: 500 !important;
    }
    .team-card .badge {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #CF9E52, #AD7B3B) !important; /* Gold gradient badge */
        color: #ffffff !important; /* White text on gold badge */
        font-weight: 700 !important;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
        border: none !important;
    }

    /* Interactive image container styling with golden border */
    .interactive-image-container {
        position: relative;
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 250px;
        aspect-ratio: 210/297;
        overflow: hidden;
        border-radius: 14px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
        background: linear-gradient(#151515, #151515) padding-box,
                    linear-gradient(135deg, #CF9E52, #E6C587, #AD7B3B, #CF9E52) border-box !important;
        border: 2px solid transparent !important;
    }

    /* Sliding wrapper inside the container */
    .image-slider-wrapper {
        display: flex;
        width: 300%;
        height: 100%;
        transition: transform 0.45s cubic-bezier(0.25, 1, 0.5, 1);
        /* Default: Show middle image (img-2), which is shifted by -33.333% */
        transform: translateX(-33.333%);
    }

    .member-img {
        width: 33.333%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
    }

    /* Hover zones */
    .hover-zone {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        height: 100%;
        width: 33.333%;
        z-index: 5;
        cursor: pointer;
    }
    .hover-left {
        left: 0;
    }
    .hover-center {
        left: 33.333%;
    }
    .hover-right {
        left: 66.666%;
    }

    /* Image shifts based on zone hover */
    .hover-left:hover ~ .image-slider-wrapper {
        transform: translateX(0%);
    }

    .hover-center:hover ~ .image-slider-wrapper {
        transform: translateX(-33.333%);
    }

    .hover-right:hover ~ .image-slider-wrapper {
        transform: translateX(-66.666%);
    }

    /* Indicator dots/bars */
    .indicator-bar {
        position: absolute;
        bottom: 12px;
        left: 50%;
        transform: translateX(-50%);
        display: flex;
        gap: 6px;
        z-index: 4;
        pointer-events: none;
    }
    .ind-dot {
        width: 14px;
        height: 4px;
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
        border-radius: 2px;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
    }
    
    /* Default: Second dot is active */
    .ind-2 {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        width: 22px;
    }

    .hover-left:hover ~ .indicator-bar .ind-1 {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        width: 22px;
    }
    .hover-left:hover ~ .indicator-bar .ind-2,
    .hover-left:hover ~ .indicator-bar .ind-3 {
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
        width: 14px;
    }

    .hover-center:hover ~ .indicator-bar .ind-2 {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        width: 22px;
    }
    .hover-center:hover ~ .indicator-bar .ind-1,
    .hover-center:hover ~ .indicator-bar .ind-3 {
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
        width: 14px;
    }

    .hover-right:hover ~ .indicator-bar .ind-3 {
        background-color: #ffffff;
        width: 22px;
    }
    .hover-right:hover ~ .indicator-bar .ind-1,
    .hover-right:hover ~ .indicator-bar .ind-2 {
        background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
        width: 14px;
    }
</style>
